  "description": "<p>As a<span> 4</span><em>-time Good Housekeeping Bedding Award winner</em><strong>,<span> </span></strong>our<strong><span> </span></strong><a href=\"https://rest.com/products/evercool-comforter\" title=\"Evercool® Cooling Comforter\"><strong>Evercool® Cooling Comforter</strong></a><span> </span>is crafted with proprietary Evercool® fabric for a sleep experience that’s as advanced as it is indulgent. The cool-to-the-touch surface regulates temperature seamlessly through the night, while moisture-wicking performance keeps you dry and comfortable. With its luxuriously soft, smooth finish, every night becomes effortless restoration.<br><br><a href=\"https://rest.com/products/evercool-comforter\" title=\"Evercool® Cooling Comforter\">How It Feels</a></p>\n<p>Refreshingly cool and luxuriously soft — perfect for hot sleepers</p>",
